  "description": "**EMAIL ONLY TO REGISTER INTEREST** \n\nOne bedroom apartment with balcony situated on the 5th floor including one undesignated car space. \n\nRent: €2,200 per month \n\nThis apartment has a fitted electric flame affect fire and a tiled balcony. The bathroom have fully tiled walls and floors. The kitchen has tiled floors, fully fitted units with tiled surrounds and incorporate an integrated fridge freezer, electric hob & oven, extractor and a washer/drier. The Rockfield Residential Scheme is access controlled and the apartment has the right to park one car (undesignated). Rockfield is one of Dublin's most exciting residential developments being situated on a mature site overlooking the beautiful Airfield Trust. Rockfield is Dublin's only development to benefit from an on site Luas Stop, offering journey times of 16 minutes to St. Stephens Green and 10 minutes to Sandyford. Located within minutes walk of the new Dundrum Town Centre, Rockfield offers an unsurpassed level of amenity.",
